Compute the order book imbalance for BTC.ts:
Fetch the top 20 levels with `fetchOrderBook` and compute imbalance = (bidVol - askVol) / (bidVol + askVol), ranging from -1 (all asks) to +1 (all bids).

```typescript
import ccxt from 'ccxt';

const exchange = new ccxt.binance();
const book = await exchange.fetchOrderBook('BTC/USDT', 20);
const bidVol = book.bids.reduce((sum, level) => sum + Number(level[1] ?? 0), 0);
const askVol = book.asks.reduce((sum, level) => sum + Number(level[1] ?? 0), 0);
const imbalance = (bidVol - askVol) / (bidVol + askVol);
console.log(`bid volume: ${bidVol}`);
console.log(`ask volume: ${askVol}`);
console.log(`imbalance: ${imbalance.toFixed(4)}`);
```

