Fetch OHLCV for DOGE/USDT on lbank and c.java:
Fetch 1h candles with `fetchOHLCV` and average the last 20 closes (index 4) to get the 20-period SMA.

```java
import io.github.ccxt.exchanges.Lbank;
import io.github.ccxt.types.OHLCV;
import java.util.List;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Lbank exchange = new Lbank();
        int period = 20;
        List<OHLCV> candles = exchange.fetchOHLCV("DOGE/USDT", "1h", null, 100L);
        if (candles.size() < period) {
            System.out.println("not enough candles");
            return;
        }
        double sum = 0;
        for (OHLCV c : candles.subList(candles.size() - period, candles.size())) {
            sum += c.close;
        }
        System.out.println("SMA(" + period + ") = " + (sum / period));
    }
}
```

