Fetch balance on kraken and print free v.ts:
Call `fetchBalance` and, for each currency, print its `free` (available) and `used` (locked in orders) amounts.

```typescript
import ccxt from 'ccxt';

const exchange = new ccxt.kraken({ apiKey: 'YOUR_API_KEY', secret: 'YOUR_SECRET' });
const balance = await exchange.fetchBalance();
const skip = new Set(['info', 'timestamp', 'datetime', 'free', 'used', 'total', 'debt']);
for (const code of Object.keys(balance)) {
    if (skip.has(code)) continue;
    const b = balance[code];
    console.log(`${code}: free=${b.free ?? 0} used=${b.used ?? 0}`);
}
```

