Fetch my trades page by page on coinbase.ts:
coinbaseexchange's `fetchMyTrades` requires a symbol and accepts `since` (sent as `start_date`), so page through your fills by advancing `since` to just after the newest trade of each page until a short page comes back.

```typescript
import ccxt from 'ccxt';

