Fetch funding rate history for the last.java:
Bybit returns at most 200 funding entries per call, so loop `fetchFundingRateHistory` on the `BTC/USDT:USDT` perpetual from 90 days ago, advancing `since` past the last entry each time.

```java
import io.github.ccxt.exchanges.Bybit;
import io.github.ccxt.types.FundingRateHistory;

import java.util.ArrayList;
import java.util.HashMap;
import java.util.List;

public class Main {
